'' See the source's header: a '#cmdline' naming a file adds an INPUT, not an option,
'' and a '.rc' so named reaches the resource compiler like any other.
''
'' It has its own '.rc' rather than sharing resource.test's: the '.res' is an
'' intermediate named after the script, and two tests compiling one script in
'' parallel would race for it.
'' TEST: cli
'' ARGS: -target win64-msvc tests/driver/src/cmdline-rc.bas -o tests/driver/cmdlinerc.exe
'' ENV: TKO_LIBPATH=toolchains/tiko-windows/lib/win64-msvc
'' EXPECT-EXIT: 0
'' EXPECT-FILE: tests/driver/cmdlinerc.exe
'' EXPECT-NO-FILE: tests/driver/src/cmdline-res.res
